# A play session for the owner's M4 listening (docs/OPENAL_MIGRATION_PLAN.md section 4.5): the game's audio on
# OpenAL Soft -- the native sound manager in place of FMOD (DOTHEROES_NATIVE_AUDIO=1) -- on build/r8/rel36 (rel31,
# the M3 build, with M4's voice and device-recovery work, the movies' sound and the calibrated reverb: rel35, the
# owner's first listening session's build; rel36 adds the save-data screen's fix, docs/SAVE_UI.md, the audio the
# same), otherwise as owner_play_r8 (rel27, the FMOD reference). The frame trace's hitch captures from 5 s, so a
# freeze on the title screen is caught (rel35's session froze there; its captures began at 60 s):
#   SCENARIO=owner_play_m4 build/venv/Scripts/python.exe tests/boot_smoke.py
# The validated configuration, sound on the default output, the frame-rate readout, normal damage, fullscreen,
# 144 fps synced to the display (benchmark pacing, FIFO present). Saves in build/play-route/gamedata, the session
# root shared with owner_play_r8 (seeded from a copy of the owner's save; the owner's own saves are not touched), so
# the same place can be heard on rel27 by starting owner_play_r8 after this. Records frames.log, record.log,
# hitches (F8, or L3+R3: mark a moment that sounds wrong) and a copy of the save each time the game saves.
# Close the window when done.
#! env BIN=build/r8/rel36/dotheroes.exe DOTHEROES_NATIVE_AUDIO=1
#! env GAMEDATA=build/play-route/gamedata RUNS_IN=build/sessions KEEP_RUNS=1000 PREEMPT_TESTS=1
#! env DOTHEROES_PPFX_NATIVE=1 DOTHEROES_NATIVE_CD=1 DOTHEROES_NATIVE_SOLVER=1,2,4,5,6 GCM_WRAP_LAP=1 DOTHEROES_PRESENT_ONCE=1
#! env DOTHEROES_BENCH=1 PS3RECOMP_VK_PRESENT_MODE=fifo DOTHEROES_FPS=0 DOTHEROES_DEV_CANT_DIE=0 PS3_SAVEDATA_PICKER=1
#! env WINDOW=1 PS3RECOMP_VK_FULLSCREEN=1 AUDIO=1 PS3_OSD_FPS=2 DUMP=0 SHOT_EVERY=0 PS3_VERBOSE=0
#! env DOTHEROES_DEV_KEYS=1 DOTHEROES_DEV_STATE=1 DOTHEROES_DEV_RECORD=1 DIAG_FRAMES=frames.log
#! env PS3_FTRACE_ROLL=hitch PS3_FTRACE_ROLL_FROM=5 DOTHEROES_PHYS_STATS=1
#! env PS3RECOMP_SPIRV_CACHE=build/play-route/cache
#! secs 14400
until_exit ${SAVE_COPIES:-build/checkpoints/owner-play-m4}
